ening was created by 2 people with help from 1 amazing music composer.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEFIANCE MODE: &quot;Infinity!!!&quot; There is no end to DEFIANCE MODE. Play for bragging rights by reaching the highest round in the shortest amount of time as you strive to dominate the leaderboard.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first version of the main theme song was created by the founder at 2ish AM after playing \u201cPapers Please\u201d for hours.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Camp Z is a WWII alternate-history, 2D side scrolling, strategic shooter. It is a work of fiction made in the context of reality, intended to honor those who fought for the freedom of the world. In no way is it intended to glorify evil, but to honor the perpetual fight against it.\u00a0I intend to carry forward the memory of my grandfathers, who both fought in WWII, and to honor all those who fought and fight for goodness to prevail.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please spread the word about Camp Z. My intent is to continue building this world and story. In Camp Z The Awakening, you will learn about the world of CAMP Z and begin your fight against tyranny. It is your training. Train well. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014 Game Master</i></p>",
